      <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 15:47:01 GMT</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>Ashwin Gopinath</dc:creator>
      <description>http://x.com/i/article/2061831458205880320

Tweet: https://x.com/ashwingop/status/2061836996541083912
Primary URLs:
